{
  "schema": "cadence-provider-onboarding/v1",
  "contract": "Single onboarding record for cadence providers. Every provider on any cadence surface (catalog endpoint/secret, provider-availability env, quota family, peer-review orchestrator maps) must have one entry here; every expected-but-absent surface must carry an exception with a reason. Checked by scripts/cadence_provider_onboarding.py; secret names only, never values.",
